---
// first.astro -- "What is FIRST?"
// Content pulled directly from the old site's /first page.
import InfoLayout from "../layouts/InfoLayout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<InfoLayout
  title="What is FIRST?"
  description="FIRST is a global organization dedicated to the advancement of STEM and business education."
>
  <section>
    <p class="lead">
      FIRST&reg; is a global organization dedicated to the
      advancement of STEM and business education. It is their
      mission to help build today's youth into the science and
      technology leaders of the future through hands-on experience
      and competitive learning.
    </p>
    <p>
      We compete in the FIRST&reg; Robotics Competition, which is
      for high school students across the world. In January each
      year, we are tasked with rules for a competitive robotics
      game. From there, we have two months to design, build, wire,
      and program a robot for this game, using subteams to divide
      the work and do it as a team. Then we compete! We have two
      district competitions, and if we perform well, we can move on
      to compete at the state competition.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================
       SEASON TIMELINE
       Simple visual summary of the FIRST season structure
       described above -- not on the old site, added for clarity.
       ===================================================== -->
  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">The Season</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">How a Season Works</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">January</p>
        <h3>Kickoff</h3>
        <p class="muted">The game rules for the season are revealed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Jan -- Mar</p>
        <h3>Build Season</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Six weeks to design, build, wire, and program a robot as a team.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Spring</p>
        <h3>Competition</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          District competitions, and -- if we perform well -- state
          and world championships.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InfoLayout>
